<title>FRANCE: Block of Synthelabo shares trade.</title>
<headline>Block of Synthelabo shares trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 670,000 shares in pharmaceuticals company Synthelabo traded at 0900 GMT, representing 1.3 percent of its capital, at a price of 734 francs per share, on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>By 0930, the shares lost 0.27 percent at 737 francs in volume of 675,239 shares while the SBF 120 index gained 1.76 percent.</p>
</text>
